    {
      "type": "property",
      "property": "ClusterName",
      "inputType": "select",
      "id": "queries",
      "label": "Cluster Name",
      "visible": true,
      "search": "{AWS/EKS,ClusterName} MetricName=\"apiserver_request_total\"",
      "populateFrom": "ClusterName",
      "defaultValue": "__FIRST"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# Amazon EKS - Control Plane Metrics\n⚠️ Covers the control plane only. All this info is available in the EKS console's **Observability** tab → **Control plane** sub-tab, with basic node count / failed node count included if the **CloudWatch Observability EKS add-on** (Container Insights) is installed."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## 🌐 Cluster Overview - All Clusters\nRequest volume, server errors, and etcd storage across **every cluster** in this account/region. Each line represents a different cluster, discovered automatically via a search expression. **This section is NOT affected by the Cluster Name dropdown above.**"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "metrics": [
          [
            {
              "expression": "SEARCH('{AWS/EKS,ClusterName} MetricName=\"apiserver_request_total\"', 'Sum', 300)",
              "id": "e1",
              "label": "${PROP('Dim.ClusterName')}"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "title": "Requests - All Clusters"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 4,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "metrics": [
          [
            {
              "expression": "SEARCH('{AWS/EKS,ClusterName} MetricName=\"apiserver_request_total_5XX\"', 'Sum', 300)",
              "id": "e2",
              "label": "${PROP('Dim.ClusterName')}"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "title": "Requests HTTP 5XX - All Clusters",
        "annotations": {
          "horizontal": [
            { "label": "Investigate - tune per workload", "value": 5, "color": "#ff9900" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 4,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "metrics": [
          [
            {
              "expression": "SEARCH('{AWS/EKS,ClusterName} MetricName=\"etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_use_in_bytes\"', 'Maximum', 300)",
              "id": "e3",
              "label": "${PROP('Dim.ClusterName')}"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "title": "etcd Database Usage - All Clusters"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## 🖥️ Node Overview - All Clusters\nWorker node count and failed node count across **every cluster** in this account/region, discovered automatically via a search expression. Requires the **CloudWatch Observability EKS add-on** (Container Insights) to be installed on each cluster - clusters without it will not appear.\n\n**This section is NOT affected by the Cluster Name dropdown above.**"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "metrics": [
          [
            {
              "expression": "SEARCH('{ContainerInsights,ClusterName} MetricName=\"cluster_node_count\"', 'Average', 300)",
              "id": "e4",
              "label": "${PROP('Dim.ClusterName')}"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "title": "Node Count - All Clusters"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
